    "body": "```from openfermion.hamiltonians import MolecularData\r\nfrom openfermion.transforms import get_fermion_operator\r\nfrom openfermion.transforms import up_then_down\r\nfrom openfermion.ops import normal_ordered\r\nfrom openfermion.utils import reorder\r\nfrom openfermion.transforms import bravyi_kitaev\r\n\r\n\r\ngeometry = [('H', (0., 0., 0.)), ('H', (0., 0., 0.6))]\r\nmolecule = MolecularData(geometry, 'sto-3g', 1,\r\n                         description=\"0.6\")\r\nmolecule.load()\r\nmolecular_hamiltonian = molecule.get_molecular_hamiltonian()\r\nhamiltonian = normal_ordered(get_fermion_operator(molecular_hamiltonian))\r\n\r\nprint hamiltonian\r\nprint '\\n----------------------\\n'\r\nprint reorder(hamiltonian,order_function=up_then_down)\r\nprint '\\n----------------------\\n'\r\nprint reorder(hamiltonian,num_modes = 8, order_function=up_then_down)\r\n\r\nbk_hamiltonian = bravyi_kitaev(hamiltonian)\r\nprint '\\n----------------------\\n'\r\nprint bk_hamiltonian\r\nprint '\\n----------------------\\n'\r\nprint reorder(bk_hamiltonian,order_function=up_then_down)\r\n\r\n0.17373064388 [3^ 0^ 2 1] +\r\n-0.365770571815 [2^ 2] +\r\n0.17373064388 [2^ 1^ 3 0] +\r\n-0.515062453042 [3^ 1^ 3 1] +\r\n-0.17373064388 [1^ 0^ 3 2] +\r\n-0.365770571815 [3^ 3] +\r\n-0.701337728655 [1^ 0^ 1 0] +\r\n-0.688793096922 [2^ 1^ 2 1] +\r\n-0.17373064388 [3^ 2^ 1 0] +\r\n0.881962014317 [] +\r\n-0.515062453042 [2^ 0^ 2 0] +\r\n-0.724506023965 [3^ 2^ 3 2] +\r\n-1.34221399305 [0^ 0] +\r\n-1.34221399305 [1^ 1] +\r\n-0.688793096922 [3^ 0^ 3 0]\r\n\r\n----------------------\r\n\r\n-0.515062453042 [1^ 0^ 1 0] +\r\n-1.34221399305 [2^ 2] +\r\n-0.17373064388 [2^ 0^ 3 1] +\r\n0.17373064388 [3^ 0^ 1 2] +\r\n-0.724506023965 [3^ 1^ 3 1] +\r\n-0.365770571815 [3^ 3] +\r\n-0.17373064388 [3^ 1^ 2 0] +\r\n-0.688793096922 [1^ 2^ 1 2] +\r\n0.881962014317 [] +\r\n-0.701337728655 [2^ 0^ 2 0] +\r\n-0.515062453042 [3^ 2^ 3 2] +\r\n-1.34221399305 [0^ 0] +\r\n-0.365770571815 [1^ 1] +\r\n-0.688793096922 [3^ 0^ 3 0] +\r\n0.17373064388 [1^ 2^ 3 0]\r\n\r\n----------------------\r\n\r\n0.17373064388 [5^ 0^ 1 4] +\r\n-1.34221399305 [4^ 4] +\r\n-0.688793096922 [1^ 4^ 1 4] +\r\n-0.365770571815 [1^ 1] +\r\n-0.17373064388 [5^ 1^ 4 0] +\r\n-0.515062453042 [5^ 4^ 5 4] +\r\n-0.17373064388 [4^ 0^ 5 1] +\r\n-0.724506023965 [5^ 1^ 5 1] +\r\n-0.701337728655 [4^ 0^ 4 0] +\r\n0.17373064388 [1^ 4^ 5 0] +\r\n-0.515062453042 [1^ 0^ 1 0] +\r\n0.881962014317 [] +\r\n-0.365770571815 [5^ 5] +\r\n-1.34221399305 [0^ 0] +\r\n-0.688793096922 [5^ 0^ 5 0]\r\n\r\n----------------------\r\n\r\n(-0.299205107575+0j) [Z2] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [Y0 Z1 Y2 Z3] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [X0 Z1 X2 Z3] +\r\n(0.194808676873+0j) [Z0 Z1] +\r\n(0.194808676873+0j) [Z0] +\r\n(0.181126505991+0j) [Z1 Z3] +\r\n(0.17219827423+0j) [Z0 Z1 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.175334432164+0j) [Z1] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [X0 Z1 X2] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [Y0 Z1 Y2] +\r\n(0.12876561326+0j) [Z0 Z2] +\r\n(-0.299205107575+0j) [Z1 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.132366162585+0j) [] +\r\n(0.12876561326+0j) [Z0 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.17219827423+0j) [Z0 Z1 Z2]\r\n\r\n----------------------\r\n\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [X0 X1 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.12876561326+0j) [Z0 Z1 Z3] +\r\n(0.194808676873+0j) [Z0 Z2] +\r\n(0.12876561326+0j) [Z0 Z1] +\r\n(0.175334432164+0j) [Z2] +\r\n(0.181126505991+0j) [Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.194808676873+0j) [Z0] +\r\n(0.17219827423+0j) [Z0 Z1 Z2] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [Y0 Y1 Z2] +\r\n(-0.299205107575+0j) [Z1 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.17219827423+0j) [Z0 Z1 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(-0.299205107575+0j) [Z1] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [Y0 Y1 Z2 Z3] +\r\n(0.0434326609699+0j) [X0 X1 Z2] +\r\n(0.132366162585+0j) []```",
