    "body": "Thank you @conta877! In addition to the inline comments I have two general things:\r\n- If you haven't done so, please run the PEP8 linter on your code and fix the style violations. You can install it with `pip install pycodestyle`.\r\n- So the `reverse` flag should have the property that if I reorder a FermionOperator twice in a row with the same parameters, except once with `reverse=False` and once with `reverse=True`, then I should get the same thing back? Can you add a test for this for the `up_then_down_map`?",
